  {
   "id": "p01",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "The days got shorter. One evening Rig felt his battery going down faster than before. The cold was taking it.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "dusk",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
      "pos": "left",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-04/p01.mp3",
   "durationSec": 8.42,
   "srcHash": "659ad011067911fc308f1ff53526dc245d9bb740"
  },
  {
   "id": "p02",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "He needed shelter. He had watched the animals do this. The fox slept under a rock. The birds slept close to the trunk of a tree.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "dusk",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "fox",
      "pos": "right",
      "state": "sitting"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "rock",
      "pos": "right",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
     {
      "subject": "fox",
      "rel": "under",
      "object": "rock"
     }
    ]
   },
   "audio": "signal-04/p02.mp3",
   "durationSec": 10.01,
   "srcHash": "5d8dff8a0b058a557eaf339670b7bf85b8b9c8e5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p03",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "So Rig began to gather branches. With one good arm it took him a long time. He carried them, two at a time, to a wide old tree.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "dusk",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "running"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
      "pos": "right",
      "size": "large"
     },
     {
      "kind": "crate",
      "pos": "left",
      "size": "small"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-04/p03.mp3",
   "durationSec": 9.96,
   "srcHash": "6a030118d7bfa38aa52441c16661cffeb132c991"
  },
  {
   "id": "p04",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "He leaned the branches against the trunk, one next to the other, until they made a small dark room. It was not beautiful. It would do.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "night",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "large"
     },
     {
      "kind": "crate",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "medium"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
     {
      "subject": "crate",
      "rel": "next to",
      "object": "tree"
     }
    ]
   },
   "audio": "signal-04/p04.mp3",
   "durationSec": 9.62,
   "srcHash": "372cb0ad0affe9f5f6838bba2d2978d6ec238497"
  },
  {
   "id": "p05",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "That night the water on the ground turned to ice. In the morning the whole forest was white and frozen and very quiet.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "night",
    "weather": "snow",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "hiding"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
     {
      "subject": "robot",
      "rel": "under",
      "object": "tree"
     }
    ]
   },
   "audio": "signal-04/p05.mp3",
   "durationSec": 8.26,
   "srcHash": "369b42592b19ad442ced6a8ed067ccdfea9ad530"
  },
  {
   "id": "p06",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Rig came out at dawn. His battery was low, but it was not empty. He had made a thing that kept him alive, and he had made it himself.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "dawn",
    "weather": "snow",
